{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/senatorpattymurray/videos/the-nih-director-couldnt-say-whether-were-better-prepared-for-public-health-thre/945506608479763/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/senatorpattymurray/videos/the-nih-director-couldnt-say-whether-were-better-prepared-for-public-health-thre/945506608479763/","title":"4.5K views · 1.9K reactions | The NIH Director couldn’t say whether we’re better prepared for public health threats under Trump—because we aren’t. \n \nTrump gutted NIH funding, delayed and canceled research projects, and pushed out thousands of scientists and staff. \n\nWe’re less ready for the next pandemic. | U.S. Senator Patty Murray","description":"The NIH Director couldn’t say whether we’re better prepared for public health threats under Trump—because we aren’t. \n \nTrump gutted NIH funding, delayed and canceled research projects, and pushed...","language":"en","text":"Facebook\nLog In\nForgot Account?\nVideo\nMore\nHome\nLive\nReels\nExplore\nRelated Reels\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n\n29K\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n\n1M\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n\n348K\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n\n60K\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n\n337K\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n\n291K\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n\n30K\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n\n102K\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n\n75K\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n\n687K\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n\n51K\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n\n54K\nRelated videos\n0:59\nTrump says he’d give his economy an A+++. Meanwhile, nearly 80% of Americans say their paycheck can’t keep up with rising costs. That’s an F in my gradebook.\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n71.3K views\n·\n2d ago\n0:44\nTrump says we can't take care of child care. Yet somehow we can take care of ballrooms for his parties and private jets for his cabinet members. We have a child care crisis in this country. We need to be funding high-quality, affordable child care—not Trump's vanity projects.\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n46K views\n·\n2d ago\n0:45\nYOU are paying for Trump’s war with Iran at the pump while he gets rich. A Senate Democratic Majority will finally put a check on this President and fight to END his reckless war. Make your voice heard. Vote.\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n32.9K views\n·\n3d ago\n0:52\nNOW is the time to make your voice heard. You've paid into Social Security your entire working life—you deserve to retire with dignity. Republicans want to cut your benefits. Democrats want billionaires to pay their fair share. THIS is the Social Security election.\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n78.6K views\n·\n3d ago\n0:59\nICE broke Erik Zepeda's wrist—a special needs student in California—and he wasn't even who they were looking for. No apology, no accountability. NOTHING. I am sick and tired of ICE's cruelty and unchecked violence. VOTE.\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n174.9K views\n·\n5d ago\n0:31\nTrump pursued some of the biggest tax hikes in American history, and Republicans cheered him on. I have a bill to end Trump’s idiotic tariffs—and a Senate Democratic majority will fight to pass it.\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n40.7K views\n·\n5d ago\n0:49\nTrump thinks there’s always money for war, but no money for child care. He wants to spend trillions on bombs and weapons, while cutting investments in housing and health care. It does not get more wrong or out of touch than that.\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n17.8K views\n·\n6d ago\n1:08\nRepublicans call Social Security a \"Ponzi scheme\" and talk about making cuts. Democrats have plans to scrap the cap and real fixes to make sure you get YOUR money. You get to choose what happens with your voice and vote on Election Day.\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n48.8K views\n·\n6d ago\n0:59\nTrump may not be interested in health care, but the millions of Americans priced out of their plans or kicked off Medicaid sure are. It's time to put a stop to Trump's health care sabotage. VOTE.\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\n142.6K views\n·\nOctober 28 at 12:18 PM\nU.S. Senator Patty Murray\nVideos\nView Transcript\nHome\nLive\nExplore\nSee more on Facebook\nEmail or phone number\nPassword\nLog In\nForgot password?\nor\nCreate new account","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2005.272057998809,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}